{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oo4zCHqBmZJfJfd6mSsNcA?scene=1","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:25.853397+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oo4zCHqBmZJfJfd6mSsNcA?scene=1","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/jx9d1bpT9uD4Ld69lZledrPiaMnhK7qROOc1icahJ5fXU81YGicdELvdkGaa3q1n3qgdYAASO9VjrclskXUKGwvmmRW6kuXVnI7QPYecDUoBhs/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>北京大学国际法学院（STL）将于2026年4月11日举办2027级研招首场开放日。</span></p><p><span>关于STL，你也许已经听说过一些标签：中国唯一提供完整美国法教育的法学院、全球唯一将普通法（J.D.)教育与中国法硕(J.M.)教育相结合的法学院。但在标签之外，它究竟是一所怎样的学院？四年的学习强度是否适合自己？跨专业背景在法律学习中会遇到怎样的挑战？</span></p><p><span>我们希望通过这场开放日，帮你找到这些问题的答案。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jx9d1bpT9uBkqxA0HlAnx5icz31FyM2JH3AWXE8icaV8wl81j6aQ8VBsuUoGkP5VOpvkDXW3UOrQXCdK6GMgib7VHVUU8fkzM3IQG5Hsw2rDG8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jx9d1bpT9uDM5dUEyl7L80pqRcPXP6mQW8W6lg1Psk7gZqRATCQdkwSytCd75iclrMFf5xBJQxFm8Y39MM3bNQfd47u8yRGjpTZ6zwxgFZ3w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/jx9d1bpT9uBdbCB4dNBVOnRJ2qfbeicnCdMsdebygqa8jWPzEz4TCiaplkMluqEIPbibribFOrL5rMztMCplrB1JkGqkAgicu3lmUUfT02VHkibic8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>01</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>校园走访</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>走进深圳大学城和STL教学楼，看看真实的校园环境、课堂空间和学习生活。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>02</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概览</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>从整体视角了解STL的办学理念、培养模式与发展方向，帮助你建立对STL的整体认识。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>03</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>课堂体验</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>现场参与一堂J.D.课程，感受苏格拉底式教学法的问答节奏。这里没有标准答案，每一轮追问都在逼近问题的核心。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>04</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>对话交流</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>什么样的申请者更适合STL？四年双法系如何安排学业与职业发展？我们将用完整的时间段，邀请师生与校友共同分享，帮助你判断这一选择是否真正契合自己。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>适合谁参加</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>本次开放日面向2027级计划保研或考研至STL的考生开放。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>本科专业不限。</span></strong><span>无论你来自理工医药、人文社科，还是法律、经管、外语等不同背景，STL都欢迎你的加入。跨学科视野在法律学习中具有独特价值，我们期待多元背景的同学在这里碰撞出更多可能。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>时间：</span></strong><span>2026年4月11日（周六）9:00-18:00</span></p><p><strong><span>地点：</span></strong><span>北京大学国际法学院大楼（深圳·南山区·深圳大学城）</span><span><br/></span><strong><span>报名截止：</span></strong><span>4月7日14:00</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>扫描下方二维码填写报名信息。</span></p><p><span>因场地容量有限，我们将根据报名情况进行适当筛选。报名成功后，具体安排及体验课预习材料将发送至你的邮箱。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jx9d1bpT9uAA80bIOrwwwQC35UicmhE3QqJZRrNTcIDVXDV953HzZr45CuibZI3R8xp3PeZFGO3Ng6rccIzTHxiazITJB64zpZIpyfjyrL3QJc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>温馨提示：</span></strong></span></p><p><span>本次活动安排紧凑，建议考生本人报名参加。陪同来访的家长可自行安排校园参观。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>关于后续招生活动：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>无法参加本次开放日的同学不必担心。4月至6月，我们将在北京、上海、南京、武汉、长沙、成都、重庆、西安等城市举办巡回宣讲会。具体场次安排请关注后续通知。点击 “</span><strong><span>阅读原文</span></strong><span>”可前往官网查看部分已经确定时间地点的场次。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/jx9d1bpT9uClcnVRcyzJlHEfWv5Lcd3PBzpaCg9D5sYeqibVulmr0Lj0BW2Yv1uKT4AgjnM6M8a5yrzHEuVzj67NqqCYrYY2j4zkpMYBibwCY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2f9f32b952b31d277b80cbfda3cd6e666a976a3c3c1949453f1a0b4611ce1f64","textLength":842,"sourceSha256":"3aeda488e0d2c6a4acff7e982fdac6e1c30443538b12023e785019d5dd7a78b0","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-23f980eaaebf49d7f03e","title":"2026年北京大学国际法学院2027研招开放日报名启动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:25.853397+00:00"}
